supermox-ve (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Depend on cpio: proxmox-backup-file-restore's postinst runs it without
    declaring it.
  * Depend on ifupdown and ifenslave (pve-manager's alternative to ifupdown2):
    ifupdown2 left eth0 down under sysvinit.

