supermox-ve (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Metapackage replacing the upstream virtualization metapackage:
    depends on sysvinit-core and a Debian kernel package, conflicts
    with systemd-sysv and systemd, and provides the upstream package
    name so it can stand in for it.

